%% alt: A vector query: the query embedding is filtered by tenant, access rights and date, searched in an approximate nearest-neighbour index such as HNSW, IVF or DiskANN to get the top k candidates, optionally rescored with full-precision vectors, then passed on to fusion and reranking (3.4).
flowchart TB
  Q[Query embedding]:::model --> F{Filter<br/>tenant, ACL, date}:::control --> A[ANN index<br/>HNSW, IVF, DiskANN]:::data --> C[Candidates: top k]:::data --> R[Optional rescoring<br/>full-precision vectors]:::tool --> O[To fusion and<br/>reranking, 3.4]:::tool
